# ============================================================================
# BRUTAL .gitignore  —  ai-tutor
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If any of these were ever committed in the past, they are still in git
# HISTORY. gitignore does NOT scrub history. You must run
#   git log --all --oneline -- api.env vault_path.txt TODO.md
# and if anything appears, purge with `git filter-repo` and ROTATE the key.
# ============================================================================

# ============================ 1. SECRETS / CREDENTIALS ============================
# --- This project's actual secret files (CRITICAL) ---
api.env
*.env
.env
.env.*
.envrc
*.env.local
*.env.*.local

# --- Bare key tokens / credential material ---
*.key
*.pem
